L117: We initialize the task-relevant clusters $\tilde{\mathcal{X}}^{\prime}$ to the task-agnostic primitives $\mathcal{X}^{\prime}_{Q}$. Starting from singleton clusters, we iteratively merge adjacent clusters $\tilde{x}^{\prime}_{i},\tilde{x}^{\prime}_{j}$ that minimize the task-driven dissimilarity.
L118:  | $$d_{ij}=\left(p\left(\tilde{x}^{\prime}_{i}\right)+p\left(\tilde{x}^{\prime}_{j}\right)\right)D_{\mathrm{JS}}\left(p\left(y\mid\tilde{x}^{\prime}_{i}\right),p\left(y\mid\tilde{x}^{\prime}_{j}\right)\right),$$  |  | (3)
