L127:  | $$\theta_{j}(x^{\prime})=\begin{cases}\alpha,&j=0\text{ (null task) }\\
L128: \varphi\left(f_{x^{\prime}},f_{t}\right),&j\in\{1,\ldots,m\}\end{cases}$$  |  | (6)
L129: $\alpha$ is a floor that assigns clearly irrelevant primitives to the null task; We set
